* oz theme additions

  ** SUPPORT MORE OPTIONS

     I should copy oz theme and add more options.

     Add args processing.

     Put options in exported variables.

     Eg. DOROTHY_THEME_OPTION_VERBOSE='yes'

     So that we can have something like [dorothy theme set verbose]

     And that would just override the export var and then resource the theme.

    *** new options

        verbose         show more info about location / context

        legend          show a legend prefix for each component

    *** new exports

        export the location ranges for each component segment. so that we could try
        having dynamic updating of the prompt line.
        ^ I dont know if this is stupid but it is at least a fun thing to play
        around with


  ** IN CASE OF INCOMPATABILITY OR NON-SUPPORT

     Then show this somehow.
